{
 "total": 58.278,
 "lines": [
  {
   "scene": "ann",
   "id": "a1",
   "text": "Meet Ann.",
   "start": 0.6,
   "end": 1.382
  },
  {
   "scene": "ann",
   "id": "a2",
   "text": "This year, she got a two percent raise.",
   "start": 1.702,
   "end": 3.891
  },
  {
   "scene": "ann",
   "id": "a3",
   "text": "And prices? Didn't move. Zero inflation.",
   "start": 4.211,
   "end": 7.145
  },
  {
   "scene": "barb",
   "id": "b1",
   "text": "Now meet Barbara. She got five percent.",
   "start": 7.695,
   "end": 10.412
  },
  {
   "scene": "barb",
   "id": "b2",
   "text": "Nice. Except prices went up four percent.",
   "start": 10.732,
   "end": 13.517
  },
  {
   "scene": "duo",
   "id": "d1",
   "text": "So, who's better off?",
   "start": 14.067,
   "end": 15.372
  },
  {
   "scene": "duo",
   "id": "d2",
   "text": "It's Ann, right? Her pay buys two percent more stuff.",
   "start": 15.692,
   "end": 18.868
  },
  {
   "scene": "duo",
   "id": "d3",
   "text": "Barbara's buys about one.",
   "start": 19.188,
   "end": 20.819
  },
  {
   "scene": "poll",
   "id": "p1",
   "text": "In a famous study from 1997, seventy-one percent of people got that right.",
   "start": 21.369,
   "end": 25.59
  },
  {
   "scene": "poll",
   "id": "p2",
   "text": "Then a different group was asked who's happier.",
   "start": 25.91,
   "end": 28.352
  },
  {
   "scene": "poll",
   "id": "p3",
   "text": "Sixty-four percent said Barbara.",
   "start": 28.672,
   "end": 30.664
  },
  {
   "scene": "shop",
   "id": "s1",
   "text": "Barbara, meanwhile, is out celebrating with the shopping.",
   "start": 31.214,
   "end": 34.594
  },
  {
   "scene": "shop",
   "id": "s2",
   "text": "Which, of course, now costs four percent more.",
   "start": 34.914,
   "end": 37.686
  },
  {
   "scene": "illusion",
   "id": "i1",
   "text": "That's the money illusion.",
   "start": 38.236,
   "end": 39.614
  },
  {
   "scene": "illusion",
   "id": "i2",
   "text": "We read the number on the pay slip, not what it can buy.",
   "start": 39.934,
   "end": 43.445
  },
  {
   "scene": "uk",
   "id": "u1",
   "text": "And it's not just a quiz.",
   "start": 43.995,
   "end": 45.654
  },
  {
   "scene": "uk",
   "id": "u2",
   "text": "Between 2010 and 2025, the average wage in the UK rose fifty-two percent.",
   "start": 45.974,
   "end": 50.118
  },
  {
   "scene": "uk",
   "id": "u3",
   "text": "After prices? About three.",
   "start": 50.438,
   "end": 52.249
  },
  {
   "scene": "title",
   "id": "t1",
   "text": "So, is your raise lying to you?",
   "start": 52.799,
   "end": 54.702
  },
  {
   "scene": "title",
   "id": "t2",
   "text": "Let's check the receipts.",
   "start": 55.022,
   "end": 56.358
  }
 ]
}